$ quack --help
--- exit 0
--- stdout
usage: quack [options] <action> [key=value]...
       quack [options] --list-actions [regex]
       quack [options] --interactive
       quack [options] --list-devices

options:
      --app package              the app, by its package (default: the only quack-enabled app on the device)
      --device serial            the device, by its serial as adb devices lists it (default: $ANDROID_SERIAL)
      --help                     show this help
      --interactive              pick and run actions in a terminal UI
      --json                     print JSON lines: each event, then the outcome with its code
      --list-actions             list the app's actions, or only those whose id matches regex
      --list-devices             list the devices and the quack-enabled apps on each
      --open-app                 show the app's main screen first, instead of starting it in the background
      --start-timeout duration   how long to wait for the app to answer (default 15s)
--- stderr
--- device
